00:04:39.112 --> 00:04:40.947
getting $1.6 billion

00:04:40.947 --> 00:04:42.515
in compensatory damages,

00:04:42.515 --> 00:04:43.549
meaning the amount

00:04:43.549 --> 00:04:44.550
we were damage, the amount

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:45.351
we have to be paid

00:04:45.351 --> 00:04:46.886
back to get us back to zero.

00:04:46.886 --> 00:04:48.054
The entire company,

00:04:48.054 --> 00:04:48.721
by its own

00:04:48.721 --> 00:04:50.523
valuation, is worth anywhere

00:04:50.523 --> 00:04:52.558
from 30 to $80 million,

00:04:52.558 --> 00:04:56.429
but that's not even 10% of $1.6 billion.

00:04:56.462 --> 00:04:57.864
Yes, dominion is worth it.

00:04:57.864 --> 00:04:59.032
So from Dominion's

00:04:59.032 --> 00:04:59.432
point of view,

00:04:59.432 --> 00:04:59.732
I think

00:04:59.732 --> 00:05:01.267
